OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785847717
OL,3,CTeacher, 28, would have survived, had
OL,4,Cblood clot been treated ` coroner
OL,6,FA primary school teacher who died one
OL,7,Fday after being discharged from
OL,8,Fhospital would have survived had a
OL,9,Fblood clot been diagnosed and treated,
OL,10,Fa coroner has found.
OL,12,FDena Collins, 28, died at Queen
OL,13,FElizabeth Hospital in Greenwich,
OL,14,FLondon, on January 12 2023 from a
OL,15,Fheart attack caused by a blood clot,
OL,16,Fdespite medics initially suspecting a
OL,17,Fclot may be behind her symptoms.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785847717
OL,3,CTeacher, 28, would have survived, had
OL,4,Cblood clot been treated ` coroner
OL,6,FMiss Collins, from Eltham in south
OL,7,FLondon, had texted friends and family
OL,8,Fsaying she suspected she had a blood
OL,9,Fclot after Googling her symptoms and
OL,10,Fpotential side effects of antibiotics
OL,11,Fshe was taking.
OL,13,FOn Friday, an inquest into her death
OL,14,Fconcluded at Inner South London
OL,15,FCoroner's Court on what would have
OL,16,Fbeen her 32nd birthday.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785847717
OL,3,CTeacher, 28, would have survived, had
OL,4,Cblood clot been treated ` coroner
OL,6,FAfter the hearing, her sister Clare
OL,7,Furged people to "trust your body" and
OL,8,F"advocate for yourself" if something
OL,9,Ffeels wrong as Dena had visited both
OL,10,Fher GP and the hospital regarding her
OL,11,Fsymptoms before she died.
OL,13,FDelivering her conclusion, assistant
OL,14,Fcoroner for the area Linda Jacobs said
OL,15,Fa post-mortem examination found Miss
OL,16,FCollins had died from a deep vein
OL,17,Fthrombosis (DVT), a blood clot in a
OL,18,Flarge vein and pulmonary embolism, a
OL,19,Fblood clot that occurs in the lungs.
OL,26,@oD@QOUoD@aO]pD@AOUpD@WO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785847717
OL,3,CTeacher, 28, would have survived, had
OL,4,Cblood clot been treated ` coroner
OL,6,FThe coroner said: "Had the suspicion
OL,7,Fof a DVT and a pulmonary embolism been
OL,8,Facted upon and a treatment dose had
OL,9,Fbeen given ` the fatal cardiac arrest
OL,10,Fwould've been avoided."
OL,12,F"Had a DVT and a pulmonary embolism
OL,13,Fcontinued to be accepted, she would've
OL,14,Freceived treatment dose anti-coagulant
OL,15,Fand on the balance of probabilities
OL,16,Fwould not have died," she added.
OL,26,@nD@SOUrD@WO]tD@AOUxD@UO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
