PN,37805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785847717
OL,3,CTeacher, 28, would have survived, had
OL,4,Cblood clot been treated ` coroner
OL,6,FMiss Collins visited her local GP
OL,7,Fthree days before her death,
OL,8,Fcomplaining of leg pain, and was
OL,9,Fdiagnosed with muscular pain and given
OL,10,Freassurance.
OL,12,FOn January 11, the nursery and
OL,13,Freception teacher went to the Queen
OL,14,FElizabeth Hospital complaining of four
OL,15,Fdays of leg pain, fever and diarrhoea.
OL,16,FShe used a crutch to walk and was
OL,17,Flimping because of the pain.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785847717
OL,3,CTeacher, 28, would have survived, had
OL,4,Cblood clot been treated ` coroner
OL,6,FDespite the possibility of a blood
OL,7,Fclot being noted at triage and
OL,8,Fpositive results from a D-dimer, a
OL,9,Ftest used to identify clots, she was
OL,10,Fgiven a diagnosis of a possible
OL,11,Fruptured cyst and told to return the
OL,12,Fnext day for a scan.
OL,14,FThe lifelong Crystal Palace fan
OL,15,Fcollapsed at her family home the next
OL,16,Fmorning and her father gave her CPR
OL,17,Fbefore an ambulance took her back to
OL,18,Fthe same hospital, where she died a
OL,19,Fcouple of hours later.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785847717
OL,3,CTeacher, 28, would have survived, had
OL,4,Cblood clot been treated ` coroner
OL,6,FThe coroner said she had found there
OL,7,Fhad been "errors of clinical judgment"
OL,8,Fin both Miss Collins' primary and
OL,9,Fsecondary care in the lead up to her
OL,10,Fdeath, but that this did not amount to
OL,11,Fneglect.
OL,13,FMs Jacobs noted that risk factors
OL,14,Fincluding that Miss Collins had been
OL,15,Ftaking the combined oral contraceptive
OL,16,Fpill were not considered during her
OL,17,Fvisit to the GP.
OL,26,@oD@JOUoD@fO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
