OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785847717
OL,3,CTeacher, 28, would have survived, had
OL,4,Cblood clot been treated ` coroner
OL,6,FSpeaking after the hearing, Miss
OL,7,FCollins' sister Clare said: "Dena knew
OL,8,Fher body. She knew something wasn't
OL,9,Fright and she sought help repeatedly.
OL,11,F"If there is one thing I hope people
OL,12,Ftake from her story it is this ` trust
OL,13,Fyour body, trust your gut.
OL,15,F"If something feels wrong, keep asking
OL,16,Fquestions, seek a second opinion and
OL,17,Fadvocate for yourself loudly.
OL,26,@oD@]OUsD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G8/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785847717
OL,3,CTeacher, 28, would have survived, had
OL,4,Cblood clot been treated ` coroner
OL,6,F"We hope the findings of this inquest
OL,7,Flead to accountability and meaningful
OL,8,Fchange so that no other family has to
OL,9,Fexperience all that we have endured."
OL,11,FDozens of Miss Collins' family members
OL,12,Fand friends joined the inquest
OL,13,Fconclusion hearing online, and her
OL,14,Fparents and sister attended in person.
OL,16,FA Lewisham and Greenwich NHS Trust
OL,17,Fspokesperson said: "We are truly
OL,18,Fsaddened by Dena's death and the
OL,19,Fdevastating and lasting impact it has
OL,20,Fon her family and friends.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@eO]yD@TOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G9/10
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37810
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785847717
OL,3,CTeacher, 28, would have survived, had
OL,4,Cblood clot been treated ` coroner
OL,6,F"We recognise how important this
OL,7,Finquest was to the Collins family and
OL,8,Fwe will now take steps to understand
OL,9,Fit in full so that we can consider how
OL,10,Fto take forward the relevant
OL,11,Frecommendations made by the coroner.
OL,13,F"While nothing can change the sad
OL,14,Foutcome for Dena and her family, the
OL,15,Flearnings coming out of her death will
OL,16,Fhelp drive changes for future patients.
OL,18,F"We continue to offer the Collins
OL,19,Ffamily our sincere condolences and are
OL,20,Fhere to offer any further support they
OL,21,Fmay need."
OL,26,@nD@AOUuD@AOUzD@AOU}D@JO]
